    "note": "No UK product information for a dextromethorphan + guaifenesin combination. Searched 2026-10-17: emc (by each ingredient, by the combination and by the clinic trade name) and the MHRA products SPC index (all dextromethorphan and all guaifenesin products listed; none combines the two). The MHRA Drug Safety Update on over-the-counter cough and cold medicines for children (April 2009) states that combinations of cough suppressants and expectorants were being phased out. UK single-ingredient dextromethorphan and guaifenesin products exist but are not this product. Not filled from non-UK labels. This entry is linked to the serotonergic group (dextromethorphan SmPC quote in the batch file) so that serotonergic interactions of other medicines still show."
